{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sides of a triangle are in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a7732324583dec29d1a1b2c293a65587ef92c5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6:8:9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />. Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/3/6e3ab3547648b628e30ae3dd7299011893bb335d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) \\ }\\text{the triangle is obtuse}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/5/5e56e11c13e059d2bb35dbe2cbca2fda0732be82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B) \\ }\\text{the angles are in the ratio }6:8:9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"292\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/d/11dfa65759eaa4580996b10060c81940c2c0f79f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C) \\ }\\text{the triangle is acute}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a58893ce286e53c514278884f4cbf24edce09f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) \\ }\\text{the angle opposite the largest side is double the angle opposite the smallest side}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"623\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1c0c7e494593814ba32ccfc81e80279eab881ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E) \\ }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a triangle with sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57c4f96dc49aa339e443ef0b7d16f9ce178cf84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\le b\\le c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3df79a4384bc29acd37e14b0430773d09964ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigtriangleup ABC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is acute if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/7/8675bb8d90006ed238d598773cebc89cde50297f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2&gt;c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, right if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/6/d86ee296c142d4b84c4e91927de035290e72c326.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2=c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, and obtuse if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fac0d953d9ca10d2afcd5195798eee11167cbd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2&lt;c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> were equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3df79a4384bc29acd37e14b0430773d09964ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigtriangleup ABC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> would be right, as a multiple of the Pythagorean triple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28eb10edb01b5d1369b1469e15dab327a4ad7b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,4,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/e/7eef1ed3b6b126c9ddac33006ac256c2d7bc6d37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c&lt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/91483f03d915540e4364d962fd6b0e6e296f0501.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{the triangle is acute}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\